        "description": "Sends the same text to many recipients in one request.\n\n| Field | In | Type | Required | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `Idempotency-Key` | header | string | no | Optional. Retrying with the same key returns the first response instead of sending again. |\n| `X-Allow-Duplicate` | header | string | no | Optional. Set to `true` to resend an identical message on purpose. |\n| `senderName` | body | string | yes | Sender name approved for your account. |\n| `numbers` | body | array | yes | Recipient numbers in international format. If any number is invalid the whole request is rejected and nothing is sent. |\n| `messageBody` | body | string | yes | Message text, up to 1600 characters. |\n| `sendAtOption` | body | string | no | Delivery timing. Use `Now` to send immediately. |"
      },
      "response": [
